  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "我思　peh百年烏松"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>崎仔頭赤子</b></span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">古早茫茫ê草埔叫他里霧</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">以早peh樹仔像食滷肉飯</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit-má peh樹仔是tsiânn趣味ê代誌</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ke一tsat ê kuân度</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">視野ê闊度就無仝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ke一年ê kuân度</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">智識ê深度就無仝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">重光國小peh樹仔慶百年校慶</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你看見啥mi̍h？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你想著啥mi̍h？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你聽著啥mi̍h？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">百年樹人一个一个童言童語</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">樹頂歌聲一tsūn一tsūn無仝調ê鳥語</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán ê母語--leh——lāi-hio̍h仔——你tsang去佗位去？</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><b>註：</b>Tsit首詩是leh記錄雲林縣斗南鎮重光國小百年校慶ê活動。</div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE4O_Jy99joe5ECXoAR1DuMXEbntujRjjZ1L6ZRyBLk8vGQFGYWIN4xKfUODgSKTbexICUTztu4taCsBKSU3qyKd-WptX8HXXmA0jNyE6gzmFgV5meOiWaobtip_zs0m9jOA6O5T6uqKlPFTUd70YviL8i32bll-yyvGiPJGeCYpmOrVWxuFISbi_m1A/s1424/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE4O_Jy99joe5ECXoAR1DuMXEbntujRjjZ1L6ZRyBLk8vGQFGYWIN4xKfUODgSKTbexICUTztu4taCsBKSU3qyKd-WptX8HXXmA0jNyE6gzmFgV5meOiWaobtip_zs0m9jOA6O5T6uqKlPFTUd70YviL8i32bll-yyvGiPJGeCYpmOrVWxuFISbi_m1A/w450-h640/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgZRED4_FbgmoSs0HQkn9uWM2aqTmsu-gDBmmAXai2mE6Bv1Dvb15_DveilYZulowPmICswzNguSOutmvus9y96rDgiolhrQMhafh79ntvGwNew4N9XbnrDncrUAnQKCNAKvodLkzN2a8TCyOl2THm-ZytKUB9m9O7xKZEvJVsvKvnUdB0tS-FH-GsXYw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1341%E6%9C%9F_03.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgZRED4_FbgmoSs0HQkn9uWM2aqTmsu-gDBmmAXai2mE6Bv1Dvb15_DveilYZulowPmICswzNguSOutmvus9y96rDgiolhrQMhafh79ntvGwNew4N9XbnrDncrUAnQKCNAKvodLkzN2a8TCyOl2THm-ZytKUB9m9O7xKZEvJVsvKvnUdB0tS-FH-GsXYw/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1341%E6%9C%9F_03.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><span><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。<br /><br /></span></b></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" styl